PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, it is most respectfully prayed that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Grant interim bail to the applicant {applicant} for a period of {duration_sought_days} days, pending the disposal of the main Bail Application No. {main_bail_application_number} of [YEAR];
b) Direct release of the applicant on furnishing personal bond and sureties to the satisfaction of the trial court;
c) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the applicant shall ever pray.
